; exports.def
; Module-definition file: exports the standard COM in-proc server entry points.
; No LIBRARY line: this .def is shared by every CantoIME variant DLL, each of
; which has its own output name (CantoIME-HK/-TW/-MO). The EXPORTS below apply
; to whichever DLL links against it.
EXPORTS
    DllGetClassObject   PRIVATE
    DllCanUnloadNow     PRIVATE
    DllRegisterServer   PRIVATE
    DllUnregisterServer PRIVATE
